        <div class="frame-service-desc" style="height: auto;">
            <h3>Ground & Tour Handling</h3>
            <p class="frame-service-text">
                We start planning for your tour right from the first go. Our trained and equipped ground handling services take over your charge once you land. From pick-up to drop at the airport, we manage your entire schedule and activities as desired by you. Entirely tailor made for you.<br /><br />
                Our expertise in meet and greet services, transfer and travel arrangements and premium VIP hospitality service offerings have been tested, trusted and at par with the global benchmarks. What’s more? We got a customer service team at your disposal. Now that’s a professional way to handle tight schedules.<br /><br />
                It’s only a robust system at work that can ensure strict adherence to your tight schedules, you see.
            </p>
